!! Article

Configure article reading helpers injected into literature pages.

----

!! Domain Auto-linking

Turn Domain tiddlers into inline links inside article text.

<$checkbox tiddler="$:/config/tw-pubconnector/article/domain-link/enable" field="text" checked="enable" unchecked="disable" default="enable">
  <$link to="$:/config/tw-pubconnector/article/domain-link/enable">Enable Domain Auto-linking</$link>
</$checkbox>

----

<$link to="$:/config/tw-pubconnector/article/domain-link/filter">Filter used for Domain linking</$link>

<$edit-text tiddler="$:/config/tw-pubconnector/article/domain-link/filter" field="text" default="[tag[Domain]]" tag="input" />

Any tiddlers returned by this TiddlyWiki filter are considered link targets in article text.

----

<$link to="$:/config/tw-pubconnector/article/domain-link/ignore-field">Ignore field name</$link>

<$edit-text tiddler="$:/config/tw-pubconnector/article/domain-link/ignore-field" field="text" default="link-ignore" tag="input" />

If a Domain tiddler has this field, it will be excluded from auto-linking.

----

<$link to="$:/config/tw-pubconnector/article/domain-link/aka-field">Alias field name</$link>

<$edit-text tiddler="$:/config/tw-pubconnector/article/domain-link/aka-field" field="text" default="aka" tag="input" />

This field is parsed as a TiddlyWiki list and used as alternative link terms.

----

<$checkbox tiddler="$:/config/tw-pubconnector/article/domain-link/paragraph-first" field="text" checked="enable" unchecked="disable" default="enable">
  <$link to="$:/config/tw-pubconnector/article/domain-link/paragraph-first">Link only first occurrence per paragraph</$link>
</$checkbox>

Repeated matches of the same Domain term in one paragraph can be left plain to reduce noise.

----

!! Math Equation Rendering

When publisher scripts are stripped from saved pages, formulas may stay as raw TeX. This fallback loads MathJax in the article reader.

<$checkbox tiddler="$:/config/tw-pubconnector/article/math/enable" field="text" checked="enable" unchecked="disable" default="enable">
  <$link to="$:/config/tw-pubconnector/article/math/enable">Enable Math Rendering Fallback</$link>
</$checkbox>

----

<$checkbox tiddler="$:/config/tw-pubconnector/article/math/auto-detect" field="text" checked="enable" unchecked="disable" default="enable">
  <$link to="$:/config/tw-pubconnector/article/math/auto-detect">Only inject math script when equations are detected</$link>
</$checkbox>

----

<$link to="$:/config/tw-pubconnector/article/math/mathjax-src">MathJax script URL</$link>

<$edit-text tiddler="$:/config/tw-pubconnector/article/math/mathjax-src" field="text" default="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js" tag="input" />

Use another CDN or a self-hosted URL if your environment blocks jsDelivr.